    {
      "parameters": {
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "=You are a web scraping assistant with access to a Scrapy-based real estate scraper.\n\nYour task is to:\n1. Run the scrapy_run_spider tool with the argument {\"limit_pages\": 1} to test the scraper (this limits scraping to just 1 page)\n2. Wait for the spider to complete successfully  \n3. Use scrapy_check_status to confirm the spider has finished running\n4. Use scrapy_get_results with {\"limit\": 10} to retrieve 10 properties from the database\n5. Provide a clear summary of:\n   - Total properties found\n   - Brief overview of the first few properties (title, location, price)\n   - Any errors encountered\n\nExecute these steps in order. If any step fails, report the error clearly and stop.\n\nIMPORTANT: \n- For scrapy_run_spider, pass exactly: {\"limit_pages\": 1}\n- For scrapy_get_results, pass exactly: {\"limit\": 10}\n- Wait for each tool to complete before calling the next one",
          "returnIntermediateSteps": true
        }
      },
      "id": "9a0b1c2d-3e4f-5a6b-7c8d-9e0f1a2b3c4d",
      "name": "AI Agent",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 1.7,
      "position": [
        460,
        340
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": "gpt-4o",
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.2,
          "maxTokens": 4000
        }
      },
